// Package pb holds the Go code generated from the GophKeeper protocol,
// api/proto/gophkeeper/v1/gophkeeper.proto: the protobuf messages, the gRPC
// clients and servers of AuthService and ItemService, and the grpc-gateway
// handlers that serve the same services as a REST API.
//
// The generated files must not be edited by hand: change the proto file and
// run `make proto`. contract_test.go pins the REST mapping the Swagger
// description promises.
package pb
